# Background Manifest

Before changing, adding, or referencing any background file, ALWAYS check this manifest. Do NOT guess based on file numbering -- the source folder and game assets use different numbering schemes.

## Rules

1. The game loads backgrounds from `game/assets/backgrounds/`. These files are the live game assets.
2. The `drop assets/final screens/` folder contains the final renditions. Its numbering represents the artist's sequential scene order.
3. When the user says "use the background from the final screens folder," look up the correct file here first.
4. Never rename or overwrite files in `game/assets/backgrounds/` without confirming the mapping below.
5. Scene 15 reuses `bg-12.png` (same as Scene 12). Not every scene has a unique background.

