## Adding a New Background

1. Place the source image in `drop assets/final screens/` with the next sequential number
2. Copy it into `game/assets/backgrounds/` as `bg-{number}.png` (lowercase, no spaces)
3. Update the scene JSON to reference `assets/backgrounds/bg-{number}.png`
4. Update this manifest table with the new entry
5. If deploying to MVP, also copy the file into the MVP repo's `assets/backgrounds/`
